                                                "sense_id": "c86d3442-6aef-3f9b-adae-50e4a25ddc1d",
                                                "text": "You know our armie is inuincible:\nAs many circumcized Turkes we haue,\nAnd warlike bands of Chriſtians renyed,\nAs hath the Ocean or the Terrene ſea\nSmall drops of water, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5cb10f84-3f7d-41d5-b463-5311475e9fb9",
                                                "sense_id": "c86d3442-6aef-3f9b-adae-50e4a25ddc1d",
                                                "text": "Nothing in this world could / Ever bring them down / Yeah, they're invincible / And she's just in the background"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d337e43-81a5-47bc-9181-ba9d82fd3250",
                                                "sense_id": "c86d3442-6aef-3f9b-adae-50e4a25ddc1d",
                                                "text": "I'm unstoppable / I'm a Porsche with no brakes / I'm invincible / Yeah, I win every single game"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
